"Yipalck Corporation is an Artonan company that bought Worli Ro-den's confiscated lab."
"The lab, on Moon Thegund in a high-chaos zone, contained demonic energies for rich patrons."
"When chaos rose, Yipalck evacuated its switched-over staff by ship with Avowed escorts."
"Staff still loyal to Ro-den were told to stay unless they quit him."
